Empty on purpose. This directory used to hold every script in the repo; they now
live next to the package that owns them:

  apps/kids/scripts/        kids-site build + the Vite apps-config dev plugin
  packages/shared/scripts/  shared domain logic (config, resolve, icons, yaml-generator, …)
  packages/infra/scripts/   Lambda deploy scripts, seeds, migrations, verifiers
  tools/                    repo-level entry points (deploy.sh, dev-admin.sh), route tests,
                            cross-app icon generators

Keeping this directory means `npx tsx scripts/whatever.ts` still resolves under
pnpm's node_modules layout, where the repo root itself is also a package.
